summary.label:
Platinum Mobile is a mobile office system based on Platinum HRM and ESS Workflow to realize HR information management, the new mobile solution will enable employees quickly and conveniently deal with affairs and not limited by time and place, thus effectively expedite the efficiency of internal communication and operations. User can directly use their mobile devices to login the client side and complete a series of tasks. Meanwhile, the executive have the access to making decisions and approvals anytime and anywhere.

Main feature:
1.	Employees are free to view their own company announcement information;
2.	Employees can query contact information of all employees at any time;
3.	Employees can define the gesture password and view my month and historical payroll information;
4.	Employees can view their own annual leave;
5.	Employees can apply for overtime and vacation;
6.	Executive officer can accept or reject the approval process at any time;
7.	Employees can sign anywhere, track record of their work.
